  "lyrics": [
    {
      "section_id": "section_0",
      "type": "intro",
      "performer": "Rihanna",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I'm friends with the monster that's under my bed",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Get along with the voices inside of my head",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "You're tryin' to save me, stop holdin' your breath",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "And you think I'm crazy, yeah, you think I'm crazy",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "I wanted the fame but not the cover of Newsweek",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "Oh well, guess beggars can't be choosey",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Wanted to receive attention for my music",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "Wanted to be left alone in public, excuse me",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "For wantin' my cake, and eat it too, and wantin' it both ways",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Fame made me a balloon 'cause my ego inflated",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "When I blew, see, but it was confusing",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "'Cause all I wanted to do's be the Bruce Lee of loose leaf",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Abused ink, used it as a tool when I blew steam (Woo)",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Hit the lottery, ooh-wee",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "But with what I gave up to get it was bittersweet",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "It was like winnin' a used mink",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Ironic 'cause I think I'm gettin' so huge I need a shrink (Yeah)",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "I'm beginnin' to lose sleep: one sheep, two sheep",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "Goin' coo-coo and kooky as Kool Keith",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "But I'm actually weirder than you think, 'cause I'm—",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_2",
      "type": "chorus",
      "performer": "Rihanna, Rihanna, Bebe Rexha",
      "lines": [
