      ]
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_4",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Eminem, Bebe Rexha",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Now, I ain't much of a poet",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "But I know somebody once told me to seize the moment",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "And don't squander it 'cause you never know when it",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "All could be over tomorrow, so I keep conjurin'",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Sometimes, I wonder where these thoughts spawn from",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Yeah, ponderin'll do you wonders, no wonder",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "You're losin' your mind, the way it wanders",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "(New-hoo, ooh-hoo) Yodel-odel-ay-hee-hoo!",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "I think it went wanderin' off down, yonder and stumbled onto Jeff VanVonderen",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "'Cause I need an interventionist to intervene between me and this monster",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "And save me from myself and all this conflict",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "'Cause the very thing that I love's killin' me and I can't conquer it",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "My OCD's conkin' me in the head, keep knockin'",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Nobody's home, I'm sleepwalkin'",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I'm just relayin' what the voice in my head's sayin'",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Don't shoot the messenger, I'm just friends with the—",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
