    {
      "section_id": "section_7",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "Eminem",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "Call me crazy, but I have this vision, one day that",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "I'll walk amongst you a regular civilian",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "But until then, drums get killed and I'm comin' straight at",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "MCs, blood gets spilled then I'll",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "Take you back to the days that I'd get on a Dre track",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "Give every kid who got played that pumped-up feelin'",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "And shit to say back to the kids who played him",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "I ain't here to save the fuckin' children, but if one kid",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "Out of a hundred million who are goin' through a",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "Struggle feels it and relates, that's great",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "It's payback, Russell Wilson fallin' way back in the draft",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Turn nothin' into somethin', still can make that",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "Straw into gold, chump, I will spin, Rumpelstiltskin in a haystack",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "Maybe I need a straightjacket, face facts",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "I am nuts for real, but I'm okay with that",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "It's nothin', I'm still friends with the—",
          "persona_id": "eminem"
        }
      ]
    },
